 Models'\r\n\r\n=== Slide 5 ===\r\n  Shape 0: PLACEHOLDER (14), name='Title 1'\r\n    Position: left=0.92, top=0.40, width=11.50, height=1.45\r\n    Para 0: 'MAST'\r\n  Shape 1: PLACEHOLDER (14), name='Content Placeholder 2'\r\n    Position: left=0.92, top=2.00, width=11.50, height=4.76\r\n    Para 0: 'Presents MAST, a taxonomy for MAS failures. Develops an LLM-as-a-Judge pipeline,...'\r\n  Shape 2: TEXT_BOX (17), name='TextBox 4'\r\n    Position: left=5.00, top=4.83, width=6.67, height=0.40\r\n    Para 0: 'Why Do Multi-Agent LLM Systems Fail?'\r\n\r\n=== Slide 6 ===\r\n  Shape 0: PLACEHOLDER (14), name='Title 1'\r\n    Position: left=0.92, top=0.40, width=11.50, height=1.45\r\n    Para 0: 'MultiAgentBench'\r\n  Shape 1: PLACEHOLDER (14), name='Content Placeholder 2'"]
